DTSTAMP:20260913T003409
CREATED:20260612T185410Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260910T172421Z
UID:39788-1790416800-1790434800@moreheadplanetarium.org
SUMMARY:Saturday Science Sparks: The Science of Sea Turtles
DESCRIPTION:The Science of Sea Turtles\n\n\n\nThis September\, navigate to Morehead to meet scientists from the UNC Department of Biology Lohmann Lab! As they spotlight their latest research\, get hands-on with biology\, physics\, and engineering while we look at nature’s best navigators and explore how marine animals make their way in the world.  \n\n\n\nMORE is happening at Morehead this year\n\n\n\nNew for 2026\, Saturday Science Sparks offers Morehead guests a closer encounter with current science. Covering topics like astronomy\, the physics of juggling\, and computer science\, this program collaborates with community partners and academic clubs\, bringing you up-close experiences in the exciting world of STEAM. Saturday Science Sparks is open to the public and included in admission.
URL:https://moreheadplanetarium.org/calendar/saturday-science-sparks-sept2026/
LOCATION:Morehead Planetarium and Science Center\, 250 E Franklin St\, Chapel Hill\, North Carolina\, 27516\, United States
CATEGORIES:Special Programs
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://moreheadplanetarium.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/olga-ga-iRgbLpf50IE-unsplash-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
